category: Libs
requires: libField3D1.7 pkg-config
sdesc: "Library for storing voxel data on disk and in memory (development)"
ldesc: "Field3D is an open source library for storing voxel data. It provides C++
classes that handle in-memory storage and a file format based on HDF5 that
allows the C++ objects to be written to and read from disk."
external-source: Field3D

